Thus we will use assemble_transport_leg for the leg.

Now we need to have loading_container_loaded and loading_container_leg_linked for beta. After loading container onto leg, we have those.

Now stage_schedule_candidate requires not origin_leg_loaded (true) and not candidate_staged_for_loading (we will achieve). So we can stage.

